WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:14,540
OK, they're here again and there are a lot of people this time.

2
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,580
There are more than a dozen of them holding weapons, the Eighth Sword Company

3
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,180
He is holding a big bucket in his hand

4
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:38,020
It looks like gasoline. Stop hiding.

5
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,940
Have you all seen what this is?

6
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:44,260
The stone statue rolled down and opened the door. Open the door.
